&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Note Payable - Affiliate.&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Mississippi Canyon has&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;entered into&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;a short-term demand promissory note with EUS.&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;At&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;December 31,&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;and 2024, the balance of this short-term borrowing was nil and $16,879, respectively. The interest is payable monthly and is calculated as the greater of&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;) Secured Overnight Financing Rate (SOFR), plus 100 basis points, or ii) 130% of the published AFR defined as the interest rate published by the U.S. Treasury to calculate imputed interest charges. During the three- month period January through March 2025, monthly interest ranged from 5.31% to $5.33%.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;As of December 31, 2024, the monthly interest rate on Mississippi Canyon's short-term demand note with EUS was 5.52%.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; padding-left: 18pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;10.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Commitments and Contingencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; padding-left: 18pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; padding-left: 18pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;As&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;December 31, 2025, we have commitments as detailed below:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 24pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 156.45pt; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Narrow';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 21.45pt; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; font-size: 9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Narrow'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Total&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 36.45pt; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; font-size: 9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Narrow'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Less than 1 year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 21.45pt; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; font-size: 9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Narrow'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;2 years&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
